title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/viewer:play
catalog: GUI command
target: viewer:play
summary: File: play one file after another — the checked selection or the query shown (selection / query / stop) [shuffle] [loop]

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``viewer`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``e e p`` → ``viewer:play selection``
* ``e q p`` → ``viewer:play query``
* ``shift+e p`` → ``viewer:play selection``
